Reliability
The application should function consistently without failures.
Security
User information must be protected from unauthorized access. Franklin (2022) identifies secure authentication and access control mechanisms as critical requirements for modern web and mobile applications.
Scalability
The system should support increasing numbers of users and reports.
Availability
The application should be accessible whenever required.
Maintainability
The system should be easy to update and maintain.
Usability
The user interface should be intuitive and user-friendly.
Martinez (2023) argues that user-friendly interfaces improve user satisfaction and system adoption rates.
